 \\\\ x & =-6,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, from left to right, the $x$-intercepts are $(-6,0)$ and $(2,0).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14038690/state.json" "file_sha256" "c568ee07db6184bb18c03b3112315def5412995c423464fac58771effdde2ea8"} {"question" "q-278354" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14038690/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7838443612f80e881d22e3fba6f19a79c53132ba3c1f35433f14d945b5365792"} {"question" "q-278354" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14038690/state.json" "file_sha256" "c568ee07db6184bb18c03b3112315def5412995c423464fac58771effdde2ea8"} {"question" "q-278354" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14038690/state.json" "file_sha256" "c568ee07db6184bb18c03b3112315def5412995c423464fac58771effdde2ea8"} {"question" "q-278354" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14038690/state.json" "file_sha256" "c568ee07db6184bb18c03b3112315def5412995c423464fac58771effdde2ea8"} {"question" "q-278354" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14038690/state.json" "file_sha256